data: {"id": "8c07a4050e2549ea-thinking-parallel_evidence-1082", "run_id": "8c07a4050e2549ea", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集证据结论\n\n### 支持候选原因的证据\n- **Pod 状态**：phase=Pending，nodeName=None，条件 PodScheduled=False\n- **FailedScheduling 事件原文**（重复出现，最近 31s）：`0/3 nodes are available: persistentvolumeclaim \"unavailable-claim\" not found`\n- **Pod YAML 配置**：Volume 定义引用 PVC `unavailable-claim`（`claimName: unavailable-claim`）\n- **3 个节点全部 Ready**，无 NotReady/Unschedulable 状态，排除节点故障因素\n- **节点无 taint** 阻止调度（`metax-tech.com/gpu.installed=false` 但 Pod 未设置对应 toleration 不是问题，因为该 taint 本身不存在）\n- **Prometheus 指标**：`kube_pod_status_phase` 确", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789114394640, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

